                    "copy": "©1997-2020 id Software LLC, a ZeniMax Media company. DOOM, id, id Software, id Tech and related logos are registered trademarks or trademarks of id Software LLC in the U.S. and/or other countries. All Rights Reserved.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
